.container
  {{view AIO.HeaderView noMenu=true}}

  .intro-content
    .iright
      .screenshot-container
        .intro-ide

    .ileft
      .info-container
        %h2 Working on Boxes
        %p
          You can code on your boxes in a variety of ways. Currently, you can use the Nitrous.IO WebIDE, or you can SSH into your box and use VIM or Emacs.
        %p
          We're working on adding more ways for you to connect and work on your boxes
        .hlinks
          %h4 Helpful Links:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.link(href="http://help.nitrous.io/ide-general/" target="_blank") Getting Started with the WebIDE
            %li
              %a.link(href="http://help.nitrous.io/categories/ssh/" target="_blank") Connecting to box via SSH

  .panel
    %button.btn.btn-primary.pull-right(_action='didClickNextScreen target="view"')
      Next

    %button.btn(_action='didClickPrevScreen target="view"')
      Previous
